Z||000005||87FieroGTx||09-04-2001||12:44 AM|||| ???????? OMG 6k ???????? I think you were ripped off!!!!!!!!!!!<P> I did a 3.1 for my 85GT and have 180rwhp and I only spent 1.5k I did a lot of the work myself but 6k sounds like a rip off.<P> You could of got a 270hp 3800s/c for that||||reg||1
